     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> And the winner was ... Atlas Fibre! </h1>",
      "body": "",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c4818",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p class=\"large-text\"><strong>A premier provider of thermoset composite materials in the U.S., Atlas Fibre exemplifies innovation in manufacturing. Through strategic investments in advanced technologies, they have tripled efficiency at their Northbrook, Illinois, facility and laid the groundwork for hyper growth through automation.</strong></p> <p class=\"large-text\"><strong>By integrating ZOLLER Solutions — including tool management, presetting, balancing, data transfer, heat-shrinking and tooling technology — Atlas Fibre ensures precision and efficiency throughout production to meet the demands of customers in aerospace, semiconductors, electrification and defense, including many Fortune 1000 companies.</strong></p> <p class=\"large-text\"><strong>Let’s also give a round of applause to MetalQuest Unlimited, Inc. on securing second place and Primetals Technologies on third place, as well as runner-up Pro-CAM Services LLC. Thank you to everyone who entered the competition and shared your stories of excellence!</strong></p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c4820",
      "bg": "",
